---
source: crates/bacnet-cli/src/tui/tests/frames.rs
expression: "screen(&mut app, w, h)"
---
" bacnet ┌ Help (? or Esc to close) ────────────────────────────────────┐ ? help "
"┌ Device│ Global                                                       │───────┐"
"│  Insta│   ?  q  L       Help; quit (guards open changes); log pane   │  Seen │"
"│> 1001 │   Ctrl-C        Cancel the running operation; twice quits    │  2s   │"
"│  1002 │   p  c  x       Profiles; connect; disconnect/cancel         │  2s   │"
"│  1003 │   W  u          Arm or disarm writes; the session ledger     │  2s   │"
"│  1004 │ Devices                                                      │  2s   │"
"│  2001 │   d  Enter      Who-Is form; browse the selected device      │  7s   │"
"│       │   Up Down j k   Move; PgUp PgDn Home End jump                │       │"
"│       │   s  S  /       Sort column; reverse; filter (Esc clears)    │       │"
"│       │ Browser                                                      │       │"
"│       │   Tab  Enter    Next pane; read the selected object          │       │"
"│       │   /  r  a  Esc  Filter; read again; watch the object; back   │       │"
"│       │   w  n          Write; relinquish a slot (writes armed)      │       │"
"│       │ Screens                                                      │       │"
"│       │   3 4 5 1  x    Watch list; network; SC; devices; unwatch    │       │"
"│       │   :             watch DEVICE OBJECT [PROPERTY]; csv on|off   │       │"
"│       │   r  m  Tab     Network: read BBMD; survey BDTs; next table  │       │"
"│       │ Who-Is form                                                  │       │"
"│       │   Tab Up Down   Next or previous field                       │       │"
"│       │   Left Rt Space Change the scope                             │       │"
"│       │   Enter  Esc    Send (again past a warning); close           │       │"
"└ Who-Is│ Read-only until W arms writes; :writem sends a batch.        │───────┘"
"        └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘        "
